/**
 * @file sallen-key-LP.cnl
 *   Test case for linNet.\n
 * The known transfer function of the Sallen-Key low pass is reproduced
 * (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sallen%E2%80%93Key_topology as of Jan 23,
 * 2015):
 *                         1
 * H(s)= ------------------------------------
 *        1 + C2*(R1+R2)*s + C1*C2*R1*R2*s^2
 * 
