 * with this program. If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
 */

U   Ui  gnd in
DEF Uo  gnd out

OP  OP  opp opm out
PI  nul out opm

R   R1  in  k0
R   R2  k0  opp

C   C1  k0  out
C   C2  opp gnd
